= Technology Option - Headphones (rejected) [TECH-08] =

**Report Format:** §1.3 Technology

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|TECH-08
|Name|Headphones (rejected)
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Group reasoning.
|Category|Wearable
|Capabilities|Private audio; nothing overheard.
|Limitations|Hard to put on; conflict with hearing aids.
|Maturity and feasibility|High.
|Failure and fallback behaviour|Not applicable - rejected.
|Benefits|Serves HV-03: cues stay private.
|Drawbacks|Shuts out birdsong, wind and the companion's voice: the very things the walk attends to. Masks traffic and alarms (HV-04).
|Selected or rejected|Rejected. Open-ear (bone-conduction) headsets deferred; could be tried in EM-04.

